<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Kadence" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Tour de Himmelfart 2026: Kongeetapen i Odder</name>
    <desc>Stage 5 of Tour de Himmelfart 2026, the queen stage, in Odder on Saturday 16 May 2026: a lap of 15.7 km from Vestermarken out by Vennelundsvej, Ballevej and Bondesvadvej to Tvenstrup, up Pederstrupvej to the hill sprint at Pederstrup (6.4 km), round by Løjenkær, down Findalsvej through the valley of Hads Bæk at Balle Findal, and home by Balle, Drammelstrup and Snærild to the finish on Vestermarken. The race's own route file (Odder Cykel Klub, https://www.tourdehimmelfart.dk/5-etape/), heights as in it, which agree with EU-DEM v1.1 within a metre. The waypoints are the hill sprint and the two drop zones, from the organiser's map of the stage.</desc>
  </metadata>
